data_H2_molecular
# H2 molecule (diatomic, neutral) in a P1 cubic box.
# Bond length 0.74 Å (experimental r_e for H2 ground state).
# Box edge 10.0 Å so PBC images don't interact (used as a molecular fixture
# only — the canonical L1 quantum slot fixture uses bond length to compute
# PySCF FCI / PennyLane VQE ground state).
# Source: NIST Atomic Spectra Database, https://physics.nist.gov/PhysRefData/Handbook/Tables/hydrogentable2.htm
_cell_length_a 10.0
_cell_length_b 10.0
_cell_length_c 10.0
_cell_angle_alpha 90.0
_cell_angle_beta 90.0
_cell_angle_gamma 90.0
_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M 'P 1'
_symmetry_Int_Tables_number 1
